{"id":"a5543a92447a0293","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-deduction-theorem.md","title":"Deduction Theorem","display":"thm-deduction-theorem — Deduction Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-deduction-theorem","aliases":["92-thm-deduction-theorem"],"display":"thm-deduction-theorem — Deduction Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-deduction-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-deduction-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-deduction-theorem — Deduction Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)\">\\(G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence-set parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\Phi]\">\\(G[\\Phi]\\)</span> (definition-target axiom extension)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deduction\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash{}&amp;\nG[\\Phi]\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,A_G\\cup\\Phi,R_G),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G[\\Phi\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}]\\vdash\\psi\n\\Longrightarrow G[\\Phi]\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deduction\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash{}&amp;\nG[\\Phi]\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,A_G\\cup\\Phi,R_G),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G[\\Phi\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}]\\vdash\\psi\n\\Longrightarrow G[\\Phi]\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>演绎定理：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>可从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>推导，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\to \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\to \\psi\\)</span>可从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>推导</li>\n<li>这是命题逻辑和谓词逻辑的核心工具</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\Phi]\">\\(G[\\Phi]\\)</span> 明确表示把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 加入公理集后的形式系统，避免把句子集合误当成可证关系左侧的形式系统</li>\n<li>证明是对有限证明序列的归纳；Generalization 情形使用句子没有自由变量这一条件</li>\n<li>这里把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>限制为句子，从而自动满足一阶演绎定理对Generalization的自由变量侧条件</li>\n<li>用于证明逻辑性质和简化推导</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence-set parameter, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G[\\Phi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deduction\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash{}&\nG[\\Phi]\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,A_G\\cup\\Phi,R_G),\\\\\n&\\forall\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G[\\Phi\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}]\\vdash\\psi\n\\Longrightarrow G[\\Phi]\\vdash(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\to \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"G[\\Phi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1743,"backlinks":[{"id":"547330c19863e2e8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]$ (one-axiom extension, using the constructor from [[92-thm-deduction-theorem]])"},{"id":"1e2b0ebca4f5fffb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]$ (one-step consistency extension, see [[92-thm-deduction-theorem]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-272","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-deduction-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["51c43e0240787ebb","35c764f4e9f21f28","e0eabee5d77258a7","90f32e29c9d553ed"]}